[{"id":2661594755,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6epLaD","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?u=6e9313e254649f6dc55e92536596487ac10bf5a2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","login":"allenwp","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp"},"body":"My review of the code was not very thorough, but the user experience of this PR looks great to me, now that the intensity slider extends to negative stops and the `+`/`-` signs are shown on the intensity value.\r\n\r\nThanks!","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103583#pullrequestreview-2661594755","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103583","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-03-05T15:50:49Z"},{"id":2668482214,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6fDc6m","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nI find the \"stop count\" UX more difficult to wrangle around when I want to set precise color values though, like `Color(2, 0, 0)`:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8686d53f-9fbe-481c-acc4-8741998a2c3b)\r\n\r\nIt seems the exact stop count I need to use is a bit less than `+2.31`, so I can't ente